  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A force acts on a cube of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> that accelerates upwards along a vertical frictionless surface.</p>\n<p>The magnitude of the force is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> and it acts at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span> to the vertical.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the acceleration of the cube?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F cos \\theta-mg}{m}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F sin \\theta-mg}{m}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F cos \\theta-g}{m}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F sin \\theta-g}{m}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
